      "text": "Section 1. Every construction contract, including those involving alterations, repairs, or rehabilitation, to which any mayoral or non-mayoral agency is a part, or the payment of which will be made in whole or in part from City funds, shall require that the following information be submitted with every bid thereon which shall be made a part of the bid documents for all such contracts and sworn to by the bidder:",
